-- ProxyLink — a branded link redirect. Five flat fields: a free-form
-- tag, a refined-String URL (format:url), a String title, a String
-- description, and a refined-String image URL (format:url).
--
-- Static rows: none. Identity (label / description / icon) is
-- registered by defineSystemEntity on the TS side.
--
-- Phase 3d of the system-entities sweep — see
-- workstreams/ts-elimination/briefs/phase-3d-system-entities-wholesale-flip.md.
-- `UrlStr` extracted as a top-level refined-String atom because
-- `|`-refinement is a type-decl-level form only (predicates don't
-- parse at field-position type-expr slot). Same path-(b) pattern as
-- profile_phone.fenel's PhoneNumber / PhoneLabel. The atom is named
-- after the convention in paths.fenel (PathStr / EmojiString) — short
-- type-suffixed names for refined-String atoms that bind a single
-- named-set predicate. All five field labels humanize cleanly.

@entity
@label "URL"
@description "String constrained to a valid URL (format:url predicate)"
UrlStr = String | value ∈ format:url

@entity
@codeName "proxy_link"
@label "Proxy Link"
@description "A branded link redirect"
@icon "link"
@fieldLabel "url" "URL"
ProxyLink = ProxyLink tag: String url: UrlStr title: String description: String image: UrlStr
